api_examples:
Example usage (illustrative):

// create a stream w/ a 250ms soft deadline for local handlers
ctx := WrapContextWithSoftDeadline(parentCtx, 250*time.Millisecond)
w := NewStreamWrangler(ctx, underlyingStream)
for {
    msg, err := w.Next(ctx)
    if err == ErrStreamClosed {
        break
    }
    if err != nil {
        // treat ErrStreamCancelledByClient as an intentional cancellation,
        // not a server transient failure.
        if errors.Is(err, ErrStreamCancelledByClient) {
            log.Printf("client cancelled: %v", err)
            break
        }
        // otherwise surface for retry logic
        return err
    }
    handleMessage(msg)
}
// cooperative close with reason sent to server for observability
_ = w.CloseWithReason(context.Background(), "user-abort:signup-flow-timeout")

Notes: The soft deadline only affects the SDK-side cooperative shutdown. Callers may still cancel the parent context to force immediate teardown.
